flowchart TB
    DATA[PhysioNet PSV recordings or validated imports]
    REPLAY[FastAPI hourly replay<br/>Only observations through the selected hour]
    MODEL[Shared 127-feature preprocessing<br/>LightGBM v1 CPU inference]
    SIGNAL[Save score history<br/>Raise an alert on an upward threshold crossing]
    DASH[Clinician dashboard<br/>Vitals, labs, history, reliability and review checkpoints]
    REVIEW[Clinician reviews evidence<br/>Acknowledge, take ownership and set review priority]
    FOLLOW[Schedule reassessment<br/>Track due or overdue work; record completion]
    HANDOVER[Prepare and edit handover<br/>Save draft and compare revisions]
    FAMILY[Clinician publishes an approved update<br/>Assigned patient and family see their restricted view]

    DATA --> REPLAY --> MODEL --> SIGNAL --> DASH --> REVIEW --> FOLLOW --> HANDOVER --> FAMILY

    SNAPSHOT[Approved evidence snapshot<br/>Cutoff-bound readings, trends, score, alerts and care actions]
    GEMINI[Optional Gemini request over HTTPS<br/>Backend key; background generation worker]
    VALIDATE[Validate evidence and reference IDs<br/>Guidance, patient chat and editable AI draft]
    SIGNAL -. New alert during active replay .-> SNAPSHOT
    DASH -. Manual guidance, chat or AI handover .-> SNAPSHOT
    SNAPSHOT --> GEMINI --> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE -. Suggestions need clinician acceptance .-> REVIEW
    VALIDATE -. AI handover draft .-> HANDOVER

    DB[(SQLite on LinuxONE<br/>Readings, scores, alerts, care events, review checkpoints and drafts)]
    REPLAY -. Persisted state .-> DB
    FOLLOW -. Audited actions .-> DB
    HANDOVER -. Saved revisions .-> DB
    OPS[Performance and operations<br/>Offline evaluation; health, readiness and runtime metrics]
    DASH -. Inspect .-> OPS

